Do you want to[ get] better at making delicious BBQ[? You] will[ have] the[ opportunity], put[ this] on your[ calendar] now. Thursday, September 22[nd] join World[ Class] BBQ Champion, Tony Balay from Lonestar Smoke Rangers. He will[ be] teaching a beginner level class[ for everyone who] wants to get better with their culinary skills.
